OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste collections delayed
OL,4,Auntil 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FFood waste collections have been
OL,7,Fdelayed in parts of Northamptonshire
OL,8,Funtil next year because of recruitment
OL,9,Fdifficulties.
OL,11,FThe local authority said it had
OL,12,Fstruggled to recruit workers, including
OL,13,Florry drivers, to introduce weekly food
OL,14,Fwaste collections in Kettering and
OL,15,FWellingborough.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
