OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste collections delayed
OL,4,Auntil 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When central government introduced the
OL,7,Flaw that requires councils to offer a
OL,8,Fweekly food waste collection service,
OL,9,Fcouncils across the country all came up
OL,10,Fagainst the same issues ... [including]
OL,11,Fhiring additional staff to facilitate
OL,12,Fthe extra rounds," said Chris McGiffen,
OL,13,FReform UK councillor for waste at North
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire Council.
OL,16,FThe service is now due to start in the
OL,17,Fweek beginning 5 April 2027.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
